.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
# uv.lock is intentionally NOT ignored. It arrived in this file's initial
# commit alongside .venv/, __pycache__/ and .pytest_cache/ -- all derived
# artifacts -- but a lock is an input, and issue #160 Gate 7 requires a
# dependency lock sufficient for clean reproduction of every paper. An
# ignored lock makes that gate permanently unclosable.

# Ephemeral harness run state. The QG dual-harness runners create and rmtree
# these workspaces themselves, and the QG workflows upload artifacts/ as CI
# build artifacts rather than committing it. Lane receipts that carry authority
# are written to research/extensions/orion-qg/ and committed explicitly.
/artifacts/
/.orion-qg-*/
